Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.48,0:00:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来很扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm well aware it sounds bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.75,0:00:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你了解化石记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}But looking at the fossil record,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,具备我对感染的知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing what I know about this infection,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.57,0:00:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}you cannot say for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.81,0:00:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能是恐龙灭绝的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}it isn't what killed off the dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.94,0:00:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信这种理论吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, do I believe that's what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是想想甲龙行尸追着梁龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's enjoyable as hell to think about an undead ankylosaur.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉爽爆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}going after a diplodocus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.53,0:00:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个电子游戏值得预定\N{\fnArial\fs30}That there is a video game worth a preorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell, yeah. Score.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.71,0:00:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,再捡几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few more of those,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,来点铝箔和漂白剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little aluminum foil and some bleach,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.73,0:00:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能产生电压了 妹子\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got yourself some volts, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.85,0:00:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,自制电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homemade battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.58,0:00:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. - For reals?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.44,0:00:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.37,0:00:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For reals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much obliged.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.73,0:00:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到电子游戏 你喜欢玩哪种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of video games, what kind of gamer were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.35,0:00:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,角色扮演 飞行射击 模拟赛车\N{\fnArial\fs30}RPGs, shmup, sim racing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睡吧 我来守\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to sleep. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.36,0:01:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 但我不放心让你保护尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, but I'm not leaving Eugene's life in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.98,0:01:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我们一起是因为你需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came with us because you wanted help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助 不需要你站岗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are support, not point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.55,0:01:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会和你一起往北走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll move north with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.46,0:01:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我在路边找到合适的车辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}till I find the right vehicle just off the tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.38,0:01:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后五个人就会变成三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then five becomes three.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.73,0:01:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.01,0:01:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都有自己的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}We each have our missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得睡会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.01,0:01:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没见你睡过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen you do it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.27,0:01:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前以为你爱上了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought it was because you were in love with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.74,0:02:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱上一个男人的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A girl in love with a guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,努力帮他找到女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's trying to help get to his girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.38,0:02:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that were the case…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.59,0:02:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上双眼就太难受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}closing your eyes would be just too damn tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.83,0:02:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是那样就好了 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If that were the case. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.50,0:02:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见了罗西塔给你端晚餐时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the way you were looking down Rosita's shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.42,0:02:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着她的衬衫里面的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}while she was serving you dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意儿有一种催眠的魔力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, the things are damn near hypnotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金整天盯着她的屁股看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Eugene spends half the day staring at her ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.41,0:02:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怪你 这只能说明我之前猜错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not mad, it just means my theory's shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.78,0:02:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真心抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm awfully sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.56,0:02:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有对有错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm right and I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为你做过的事 还是你没做到的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something you did or something you didn't do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做过的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.83,0:02:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也当过兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂那一套「团队合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get the whole gung ho,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务就是你的生命「的屁话\N{\fnArial\fs30}mission is your life bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.77,0:03:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 你懂 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, you do. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.34,0:03:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们都有理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we both got our reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.97,0:03:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both got our missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.70,0:03:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务结束后 你要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you do when the mission's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是被惹恼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been rubbing me wrong, is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.14,0:03:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个讲公平的绅士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an even-Steven type gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.28,0:03:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我找到补给品\N{\fnArial\fs30}You help me find the supplies,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会分享电池和发出的电力\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll share the battery and whatever juice we scare up,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然微不足道\N{\fnArial\fs30}minimal as it may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:55.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（格伦 去终点站）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.64,0:03:59.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（玛姬 萨沙 鲍勃）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:08.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎所有人 抵达就能活命）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.29,0:04:52.87,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.41,0:05:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.95,0:05:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来那只三脚猫还是辜负了我们啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like that Robin Hood cat cut out on us after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为他没胆子一个人走掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think he had the sack to go out on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.10,0:05:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没走 他的东西还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He don't. Dude left his stuff here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.99,0:05:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许只是早上去拉屎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably just stepped out to drop a morning deuce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.99,0:05:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还剩一天的水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we got about a day's worth of water left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸亏天气凉快了些 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're lucky it's cooled off a little bit, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.88,0:06:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.49,0:06:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赢得赌注 - 你做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Winning a bet. - In your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在铁轨上哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.03,0:06:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你高兴得太早了 聪明蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spoke too soon, wise guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.21,0:06:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能要走很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}This might go on a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.91,0:06:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不你们快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can speed this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.71,0:06:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.27,0:06:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不应该瞎闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't be fooling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.47,0:06:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should probably… Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.57,0:06:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.15,0:06:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是最后一根巧克力棒了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that really the last Big Cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.40,0:06:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.76,0:06:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说赢了的人可以随便选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, but you said winner's choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.01,0:06:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 拿着吧 是你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, take it. It's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.43,0:07:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢得正大光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won it fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着吧 我们总是分着吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we always share.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,递过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fork it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.29,0:07:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄点早餐吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catching me some breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.59,0:07:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的箭先射到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My arrow's the one that hit first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.54,0:07:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只兔子应该归我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cottontail belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,日出之前我就守在这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been out here since before the sun came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,打猎的规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, the rules of the hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.08,0:07:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿不算数\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't mean jack out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手里拿的兔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that rabbit you're holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.32,0:07:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要了 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}is claimed, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你乐不乐意 我都要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claimed whether you like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是你 我就交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I was you, I'd hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now before you get to wishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你会后悔今早起了床\N{\fnArial\fs30}you ain't never even got out of bed this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.73,0:08:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢打赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'll bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个小贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}this bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的脑子弄得一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}got you all messed up, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.89,0:08:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说得对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.71,0:08:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你像一个魂不守舍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you walking around here like a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,活死人一样四处晃荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}who just lost himself a piece of tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.21,0:08:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小妞肯定很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have been a good'un.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.46,0:08:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小妞是不是个幼齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it one of the little'uns?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.24,0:08:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,幼齿在这里可活不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause they don't last too long out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.05,0:08:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 伙计们 冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, fellas, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,把武器先放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just put our weapons down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.55,0:08:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看能不能把问题解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if we can't figure out what's really the problem here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.55,0:08:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你喊「我要了」吗 - 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you claim it? - Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:09:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就结了 兔子属于伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there you go. That critter belongs to Len.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.64,0:09:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.59,0:09:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你想知道是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you may be wanting an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.27,0:09:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,独自行动 如今已经行不通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, going it alone, that ain't an option nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.29,0:09:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 仍然是优胜劣汰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, it is survival of the fittest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有点矛盾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a paradox right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我制定了一些规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I laid out some rules of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.54,0:09:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,来防止丛林法则分分钟上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep things from going Darwin every couple hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,让大家无压力地和平相处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep our merry band together and stress-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.98,0:09:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要做的就是喊一句「我要了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you got to do is claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.45,0:09:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以这样标记你的领土\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how you mark your territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.20,0:09:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的猎物 还有睡觉的床\N{\fnArial\fs30}your prey, your bed at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.90,0:09:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就喊一句「我要了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}One word, claimed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.90,0:09:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不喊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't claiming nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该教训他 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna teach him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,按规矩我们得教训他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rules say we got to teach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.90,0:09:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你违反了一条你不知道的规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wouldn't be fair to punish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.98,0:09:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就惩罚你有些不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}for violating a rule you never even knew existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.83,0:09:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,才没有什么规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't no rules no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there are. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.93,0:09:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才没有把你杀掉 抢走你的弩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I didn't kill you for the crossbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.31,0:10:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy there, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.80,0:10:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我要了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claimed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.31,0:10:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一句就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all you got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有屁股吃也比没有强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, ass end is still an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.99,0:10:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.49,0:10:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're stopping here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.51,0:10:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,累了反应就慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tired is slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 反应慢就会死 - 还不到中午\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Slow is dead. - It's barely noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才他妈的不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a monkey's left nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.28,0:10:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我们玩命般赶路之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us has slept more than a couple hours straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.27,0:10:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经很久没好好睡上一觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}since we went all Casey Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.13,0:10:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方看起来很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place looks safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.49,0:11:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.98,0:11:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 你想找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. You have to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但罗西塔和我也有任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Rosita and me, we got a mission, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.23,0:11:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是让这个男人活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's keeping that man alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带到华府\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting him to Washington,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.49,0:11:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后拯救他妈的全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and saving the whole damn world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.77,0:11:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要进这个塔楼 现在就进\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're going in that tower and we're going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out! Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.91,0:11:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 走开 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! - Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.07,0:11:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.91,0:11:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得留在这儿 谁来帮忙抬一下她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to stay here. Who's gonna help me carry her up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.79,0:11:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.75,0:11:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想停下还是继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna stop or you wanna keep going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.14,0:11:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 继续走 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, keep going. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定 - 对 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure? - Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.07,0:11:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 假如她都能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if she can keep going,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们也能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can all keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你们可以留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you guys can stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不需要我们 我们也不需要你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need us, we don't need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.93,0:11:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没关系的 - 你真是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. - Wow, you're an ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:12:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么她都照做是因为她觉得亏欠你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will do whatever you say because she thinks she owes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.64,0:12:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出点男人的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.68,0:12:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿停几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here for a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.91,0:12:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只在乎尤金的安全 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just care about keeping Eugene safe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.24,0:12:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才想停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only reason you want to stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.28,0:12:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直走到太阳落山\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go until sundown,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把防暴服给尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give Eugene my riot gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就给\N{\fnArial\fs30}right here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.32,0:12:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 皆大欢喜 - 除了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everybody wins. - Except her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是她妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not her mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她能走 她就能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says she can walk, she can walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.66,0:12:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就按你说的办吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got yourself a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.64,0:12:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么计划 达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the plan, Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.31,0:12:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么问\N{\fnArial\fs30}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.45,0:12:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你虽然跟我们搭伴 但你很快会走是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're with us now, but you ain't soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以问你有什么计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就想找个合适的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just looking for the right place is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.76,0:12:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对你而言不够好是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we ain't good enough for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.61,0:13:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们中的一些人可算不上友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of you ain't exactly friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己就不太友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't so friendly yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.66,0:13:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道在这外面你需要一个团队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you need a group out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.59,0:13:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说不定我不需要 - 不 你需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe I don't. - No, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.05,0:13:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该和我们待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.61,0:13:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家不一定要友善待人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People don't got to be friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.01,0:13:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不一定要做好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不一定要成为手足兄弟连\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to be brothers in arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.53,0:13:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需要守规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got to follow the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.43,0:13:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要什么你得说一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}You claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你偷东西 你就得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you steal, you keel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.75,0:13:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来有点搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that sounds a little funny,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是丢东西时就没人笑得出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but nobody laughs when something goes missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.94,0:13:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你不能撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为一旦开始就停不下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause that's a slippery slope indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你坏了规矩怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens if you break 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.33,0:13:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会挨揍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you catch a beatin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,揍的轻重取决于你的行为有多过分\N{\fnArial\fs30}The severity of which depends upon the offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.13,0:14:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及那天大家的态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the general attitude of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.56,0:14:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这种事不常发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that don't happen much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为一旦我们这种人守规矩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause when men like us follow rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.17,0:14:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且相互合作一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cooperate a little bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.02,0:14:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界就是我们的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, the world becomes ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.47,0:14:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚的住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our abode for the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.56,0:14:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是「我们」\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't no us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.35,0:14:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在就要走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leaving right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.79,0:14:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那看来就是「我们」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it sure seems like there's an us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.15,0:14:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱猫吗 达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a cat person, Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.57,0:14:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.75,0:14:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,从三岁时就爱猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loved 'em since I was three years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.54,0:14:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶劣的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vicious creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.93,0:14:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I'll tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.39,0:14:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.40,0:14:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,把自己当成家猫的野猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}ain't nothing sadder than an outdoor cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.25,0:14:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是最可悲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that thinks he's an indoor cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.97,0:15:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离他们越来越近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gaining on 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.71,0:15:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,依然是湿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.69,0:15:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,和打了光亮剂一样 没法从这上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sure as Shinola can't go up and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.51,0:15:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕过去怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about around?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.24,0:15:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不妥\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.86,0:15:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕过去至少要花一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll take a day, maybe more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.98,0:15:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然玛姬走了这里 我也要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Maggie went through, I'm going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.21,0:15:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们很接近了 - 先别说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're close. - Shut up a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:15:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.28,0:16:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是一条漫长幽暗的隧道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That there is a long, dark tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.94,0:16:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有无数蠢蠢欲动的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}full of reanimated corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要带尤金从这穿过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have full-on certainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.53,0:16:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有十足的把握能把他活着带出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I can get Eugene through there alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的建议是 多花一天时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}My recommendation would be take the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.83,0:16:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕过这里 小心驶得万年船\N{\fnArial\fs30}make the detour and play it safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.11,0:16:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你肯定不会接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I know you're not gonna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.27,0:16:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们要在这里分别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is where we've got to part ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.01,0:16:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得靠自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这些是你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Those are yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们长途跋涉 需要这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys will need them for your trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.57,0:16:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.99,0:16:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打了你一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}hit you in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.10,0:17:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,打得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.24,0:17:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.69,0:17:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么混蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try not to be an ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.84,0:17:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're both good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.20,0:17:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不承认 你真的很正点 塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to say that you are seriously hot, Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.11,0:17:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢 不过我喜欢女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I like girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.95,0:17:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm well aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.80,0:17:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们在里面遇到麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say you get into trouble in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.47,0:17:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,转身往回走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.60,0:17:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们循原路折回到第一条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doubling back to the first road we crossed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.29,0:17:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许在我们找到车之前 你们能赶上我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you find us before we find the right ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:18:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.80,0:18:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你现在的心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这一切开始之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After this all started,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.40,0:18:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我意识到自己再也见不到亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}after I realized I'd never see my family,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,和朋友之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}my friends again,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.43,0:18:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我麻木了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.53,0:18:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,日复一日 茫然无措\N{\fnArial\fs30}All day long, just numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.63,0:18:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想说 我懂你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当布莱恩宣称他想要接管监狱时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Brian told us he wanted to take over the prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.33,0:18:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道不太对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it sounded bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到我女友的时候 她已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I found my girlfriend, she was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的外甥女\N{\fnArial\fs30}My niece.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.19,0:18:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:19:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被团团围住 遭到了疯狂的袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was surrounded, pounced on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我目睹了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.65,0:19:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这些与他对玛姬父亲做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But still, it wasn't as bad as seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.98,0:19:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,比起来微不足道\N{\fnArial\fs30}what he did to Maggie's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我就醒悟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's when I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.49,0:19:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀落下的那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}That second the sword…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.43,0:19:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想大喊不要 但于事无补\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to scream "No, " But it just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩说我们可能要杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian said we might have to kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.68,0:19:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是第一个主动加入的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the first to jump in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.52,0:19:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为只是「可能」而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just hanging on the "Might."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.68,0:20:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}They ain't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.45,0:20:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久没来过人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's been here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.72,0:20:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后来的人把汽油都带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever was, they got all the gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.18,0:20:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That don't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.65,0:20:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们越来越近了 我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting closer. I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claimed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.65,0:20:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claimed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.22,0:20:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claimed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.89,0:20:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claimed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claimed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.14,0:21:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,血还是湿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blood is still wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.27,0:21:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是今天才发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This had to have happened today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.21,0:22:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.10,0:23:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.85,0:23:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她不在里面 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's not one of them. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.51,0:23:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,地上没有血\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no bodies on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.44,0:23:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这说明玛姬过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means Maggie made it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.39,0:23:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.20,0:23:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须干掉它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.29,0:23:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有足够的弹药了 - 那就冲过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't have enough ammo. - Then we'll push through.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.48,0:23:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须走其他的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.18,0:24:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保护他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.48,0:24:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞定它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.48,0:24:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,得把这车发动起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna need to air this baby out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.69,0:24:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 这样我们就有时间找回原路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, it'll give us some time to figure out how to get back on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.38,0:24:42.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（别伤害我妈妈）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.43,0:24:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别别 - 我是导航员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yo, no, no. - I'm the navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.79,0:24:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就学着导航啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then learn to navigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.78,0:24:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得汤普森吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember Thompson?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.46,0:25:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正式要求你对我当面道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm formally requesting a straight up do-over on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.24,0:25:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带领大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guided us here from Houston.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.39,0:25:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,从休斯顿平安抵达乔治亚北部\N{\fnArial\fs30}to northern Georgia without incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.26,0:25:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看并非完全「平安」吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't say without incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.51,0:25:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只出了小意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minimal incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.78,0:25:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少路线没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Navigation-wise, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.47,0:25:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.61,0:25:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果由你来导航\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot abide a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.63,0:25:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那让我这个带领大家历经险阻\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you are the chosen navigator over a son of the South.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.91,0:25:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功走过现实与虚幻之旅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has successfully negotiated the travails.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.97,0:25:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,南方之子颜面何在\N{\fnArial\fs30}and vagaries of journeys both real and virtual.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.93,0:25:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.44,0:25:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去北方 清楚了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going north. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.49,0:26:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉 怎么回事 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara. What is it? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.11,0:26:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.47,0:26:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, get up, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.48,0:26:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn left up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.68,0:26:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,才短短五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the third left turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.97,0:26:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就让我左转了三次\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've made me make in the last five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.57,0:27:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你迷路了 - 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're lost. - I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.27,0:27:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.40,0:27:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你迷路了 就说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're lost, please just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.63,0:27:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽油可经不起你这样自负地折腾\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gas in this tank is worth more than your ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.93,0:27:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想谈油耗 我们应该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to talk fuel efficiency, we could talk…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.75,0:27:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能关上车窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not rolling up the windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.73,0:27:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 里面一股腐臭味 - 停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It smells like a damn carcass in here. - Stop the van.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.96,0:27:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we stopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.40,0:27:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语] 骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mentirosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.01,0:27:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.76,0:27:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.13,0:27:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不就是你的计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wasn't your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.21,0:27:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你为什么坚持导航\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you insisted on navigating?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.82,0:27:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还让他睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you told him to go to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.66,0:27:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是说我没骗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. I never claimed otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.16,0:27:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 你为之前的诽谤道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now how about you apologize for the slander.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.64,0:27:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就算扯平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we call it square?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.98,0:27:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈脑子有毛病吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.90,0:27:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果格伦和塔拉还活着 中途无停顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Glenn and Tara were still alive and there were no significant delays.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.03,0:27:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,且保持每小时约3英里的速度行进\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they continued traveling at approximately three miles per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.13,0:27:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已在脑中精确推算过\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I timed it correctly in my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.26,0:27:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们应该在这儿附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}they might be somewhere around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.60,0:28:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们两个并非当务之急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those two are not the priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.65,0:28:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当务之急是将你送到华府\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only priority is getting you to Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.38,0:28:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我拯救世界之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I save the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.39,0:28:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能带着愧疚活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still have to live with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.96,0:28:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决不丢下他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving them behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.66,0:28:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他娘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.17,0:28:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell are we stopped?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.36,0:28:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们从隧道出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they made it out of that tunnel,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.43,0:28:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该会在这附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'd be somewhere around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.55,0:28:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逗我玩呢 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.34,0:28:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.52,0:28:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎么回事 - 开车的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My problem? - You're the one in the driver's seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.94,0:28:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你踩的刹车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who put your damn foot on the brake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.41,0:28:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他让我停车的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.93,0:28:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也不能停车 绝对不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't stop! You never stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.26,0:28:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道规矩 - 如果你知道规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know the rules. - If you know the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.72,0:28:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,规矩就是绝不停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}the rule is never stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.81,0:28:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果停下来 - 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When you stop… - Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.28,0:28:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伙计们 - 干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.57,0:28:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.49,0:28:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.42,0:28:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.55,0:28:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}You step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.76,0:28:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的半只兔子装在包里 现在没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My half was in the bag. Now it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.00,0:28:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你 这里没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now ain't nobody around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.89,0:29:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,会对半只兔子感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}interested in no half a damn cottontail except you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.59,0:29:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.28,0:29:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你还一直惦记着这点破事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only one still thinking about that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.89,0:29:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把你的包倒空 - 我说了后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Empty your bag. - I said step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.46,0:29:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿他的兔子了吗 达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you take his rabbit, Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.79,0:29:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.77,0:29:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也没拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't take nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.42,0:29:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.04,0:29:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.13,0:29:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.13,0:29:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你放进去的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put that there, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.17,0:29:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁我刚才出去撒尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I went out to take a piss.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.55,0:29:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你骗人 - 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You lied. - Didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.25,0:29:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.36,0:29:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stole.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.63,0:29:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要不要给这个白痴点教训 乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gonna teach this fool or what, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.14,0:29:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔说他没拿你那半只兔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Daryl says he didn't take your half of the rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.87,0:29:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们遇到难题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we got a little conundrum here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.96,0:29:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么是他在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either he's lying,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.05,0:29:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不可饶恕的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is an actionable offense,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.65,0:29:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}or…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.92,0:29:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会是你故意栽赃陷害他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you didn't plant it on him like some pussy,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.32,0:30:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像某个娘炮无能 骗人怂包的条子\N{\fnArial\fs30}punk-ass, cheating, coward cop, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.79,0:30:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然严格来说 这不算违反规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause while that wouldn't be specifically breaking the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.50,0:30:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是很令人失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'd be disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.88,0:30:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.87,0:30:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.22,0:30:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.46,0:30:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.35,0:30:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,教训他一下 弟兄们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teach him a lesson, gents.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.95,0:30:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是个撒谎精 我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a lying sack of shit. I'm sick of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.35,0:30:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好教训他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teach him all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.00,0:30:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见是他干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.64,0:30:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you try to stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.45,0:30:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想耍花样 就让他耍\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to play that out. I let him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.48,0:30:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说了真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.48,0:30:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.20,0:30:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.35,0:30:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.62,0:30:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来兔子头也归你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you get the head, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.42,0:31:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走吧 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.72,0:31:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找玛姬 找到玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find Maggie. Go find Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.75,0:31:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.49,0:31:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.89,0:31:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 你救不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, you can't save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.13,0:31:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便你把石头挪开 我也跑不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you got this off me, I can't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.25,0:31:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你帮我 我们都会死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you help me, they're gonna get both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.17,0:31:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.54,0:31:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有其它办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be a different way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.08,0:31:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 它们过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, they're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.18,0:31:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会走的 我不会丢下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving. I'm not leaving you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.71,0:31:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.24,0:31:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.37,0:31:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.14,0:31:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.60,0:31:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.40,0:31:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.17,0:33:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你太美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, you are so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.55,0:33:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.93,0:33:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,隧道那端布置好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of the tunnel's secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.90,0:33:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有东西要闯进来 我们会提前听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything tries to come in, we'll hear in plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.22,0:33:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没正式认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't get to officially meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.97,0:33:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.86,0:33:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉 这是玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara, this is Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.13,0:33:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬 这是塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.32,0:33:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱死你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a big fan of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.20,0:33:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在路上碰到了塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met Tara on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.64,0:33:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有她我到不了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't have made it here without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.77,0:33:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.14,0:33:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一听到我要做什么 就坚持要帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she heard what I was doing, she said she had to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.12,0:33:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just that kind of person.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.31,0:34:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.98,0:34:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.70,0:34:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道灾变的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he knows what caused the outbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.04,0:34:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.26,0:34:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.38,0:34:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜 他让你跟他去华府是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess. He asked you to go to DC with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.91,0:34:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能找到彼此真让我感动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm downright tickled y'all found each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.27,0:34:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们今晚应该好好庆祝一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should spend the rest of the night celebrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.44,0:34:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.04,0:34:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们八个人没有任何理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's absolutely no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.22,0:34:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不登上那辆货车\N{\fnArial\fs30}why the eight of us don't stuff ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.69,0:34:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,前往华府\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that van and head up to Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.03,0:34:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.88,0:34:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.62,0:34:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.25,0:34:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走了休斯顿到华府55%的路程\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're 55% of the way from Houston to Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.30,0:34:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前我们有装甲军车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up until now, we've had an armored military vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.49,0:34:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还失去了八个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}for transport and we lost eight people.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.90,0:34:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是我们的错 - 他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That wasn't our fault. - They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.31,0:34:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,开着那辆捡到的货车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't imagine we'd have better luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.74,0:34:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的运气会更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that grocery grabber we picked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.75,0:34:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,离终点站步行只需一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're a day's walk from Terminus.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.01,0:34:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道他们那里有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows what they've got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.46,0:35:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 去看看也没坏处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it couldn't hurt to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.87,0:35:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,补充一些补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load up on supplies,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.08,0:35:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定还能\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe even.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.31,0:35:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,招募他们的一些人跟我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}recruit some of them to come with.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.18,0:35:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.96,0:35:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后再去\N{\fnArial\fs30}but after.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.15,0:35:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要先去终点站看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to see Terminus.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.27,0:35:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥可能在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother could be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.01,0:35:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.26,0:35:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.68,0:35:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个原因都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}On both counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.83,0:35:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他说我是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tells me I'm wrong…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.03,0:35:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.66,0:35:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我们去终点站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow we go to the end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.97,0:35:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后去华府\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.39,0:35:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.75,0:35:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我们当时也在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. We were right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.57,0:35:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲来了一群行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole swarm of them came at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.04,0:35:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的弹药不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we didn't have enough bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.87,0:35:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着想象你在这里会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to think what you would do if you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.63,0:36:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我对着房顶扫射\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I just emptied my clip into the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.53,0:36:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望有奇迹发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I hoped for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.48,0:36:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,太夸张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.62,0:36:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你让他们别去拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like asking those guys to hold off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.94,0:36:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是跟你去找妻子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}saving the world while you go look for your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.53,0:36:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很有说服力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a persuasive guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.96,0:36:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.06,0:36:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, hey. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.61,0:36:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.46,0:36:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只有你这一张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the only picture I have of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.60,0:36:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要我的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need a picture of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.04,0:37:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不需要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never will again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.36,0:38:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,私酿威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}White Lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.13,0:38:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,做法简单 用料很少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easiest thing to make with the least amount of supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.89,0:38:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你慢点喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd start slow if I was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.61,0:38:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的胃可能比你想的更空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your stomach's probably emptier than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.95,0:38:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一切崩溃之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't been lit at dawn since.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.26,0:38:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没一大早喝醉过\N{\fnArial\fs30}before everything fell apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.98,0:38:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,崩溃 我从来不这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fell apart. I never looked at it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.71,0:38:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是觉得一切都有意义了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems to me like things are finally starting to fall together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.97,0:38:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少对我们这样的人而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least for guys like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.88,0:38:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样生活 求生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living like this, surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.92,0:38:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前就是这么做的 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been doing this from the start, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.62,0:38:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,更近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.13,0:39:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前见过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seen this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.82,0:39:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.25,0:39:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 这是个谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what it is. It's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.06,0:39:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有能容纳所有人的避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no sanctuary for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.22,0:39:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正不会欢迎你我这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't gonna welcome guys like you and me with open arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.02,0:39:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们是要去那里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is that where we're headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.88,0:39:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在想起来问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now you're asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.27,0:39:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.43,0:39:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当时在一栋房子里 没招谁惹谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were in a house minding our own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.94,0:39:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果有一个操蛋的人渣躲在房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this walking piece of fecal matter was hiding in the home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.91,0:39:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,勒死了我们的同伴卢 让他变成了行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strangled our colleague Lou and left him to turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.83,0:39:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢袭击了我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lou came at all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.15,0:39:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跑掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lit out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.08,0:39:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们追踪他到了这些轨道上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tracked him to these tracks,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.10,0:39:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到这样的标志 然后决定去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of those signs, and thus we've got a destination in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.74,0:39:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到他的脸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see his face?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.22,0:39:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有托尼看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only Tony.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.66,0:39:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够找他算账了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough for a reckoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.85,0:39:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claimed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.13,0:40:50.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（终点站）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.01,0:41:18.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（终点站）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.98,0:41:41.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（放下武器 你会得到款待 你已到达终点站）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.27,0:42:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.54,0:42:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们在外面漂泊很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you've been on the road a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.47,0:42:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.25,0:42:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来把你们安顿好 给你们做点东西吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you settled and we'll make you a plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.86,0:42:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到终点站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Terminus.
